 * STORYBOOK-LOCAL DESIGN SPEC ΓÇö `AsyncContent.*`, the ONE async-state FRAME
 * namespace (teacher's call, 2026-07-25). Three sibling frames that used to live as
 * three loose folders (`AsyncContent` ┬╖ `EmptyContent` ┬╖ `ErrorContent`) are now
 * MEMBERS of one namespace ΓÇö same tier, same job (holding the lifecycle of ONE
 * async data region: error ΓåÆ loading ΓåÆ empty ΓåÆ content), one import.
