 * STORYBOOK-LOCAL DESIGN SPEC ΓÇö `Page.*`, the ONE page-chrome frame namespace
 * (teacher's call, 2026-07-25, canon ┬º13a). Sibling frames that used to live as loose
 * folders (`PageHeader` ┬╖ `StickyBottomBar`) are now MEMBERS of one namespace
 * ΓÇö same tier (frame / layout), same family (chrome of a ROUTE: what sits above
 * the content and pinned under it), one import.
