 *   is a horizontal row, so `header`/`footer` would be a lie).
 * - `PageHeader` is NOT a generic wrapper ΓÇö it already owns semantic slots
 *   (`breadcrumb`/`title`/`description`/`actions`/`meta`) and deliberately
 *   takes no `children`.
 * - No repeating list here, so no `items` member (┬º13b list clause N/A).
 * - Namespace only ΓÇö no bare component export.
 *
 * Behaviour/skin of every member is carried over VERBATIM from its old folder;
 * this is an API refactor, not a visual one. Synced to `src` later. No
 * `@/components` imports (design-spec ports stay self-contained).
 *
 * HISTORY ΓÇö `.Container` was moved to `Container` (`@/components/frames/Container/Container`)
 * on 2026-07-26: the old frame had no `mx-auto`, no `max-w`, only right padding ΓÇö
 * a half-baked version of the "content width" concept that `Container` already
 * does correctly (┬º13c: a duplicate frame gets deleted).
